;; Ordinary Closure::call owns a temporary function, not a copied Closure object.
;; The birth index names that function cache and retains no source/receiver root.
;; Bound fake views require a proven user method and its completed lexical scope.
dec $closure_call_cache_function(pstate, nat) : porigin?
